OL,3,GNEWSABuddhist monk attacked by masked
OL,4,Ae-bike rider
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Buddhist monk has been injured by two
OL,7,Fyouths who punched and kicked him
OL,8,Fduring an attack in a riverside park.
OL,10,FKarucha Sripramote said he had been
OL,11,Frepeatedly harassed by masked children
OL,12,Fin Hebburn Riverside Park, South
OL,13,FTyneside, including one on an e-bike
OL,14,Fwho was deliberately spinning its rear
OL,15,Fwheel to throw grass and dirt at him.
OL,17,FThe monk, who was wearing his orange
OL,18,FBuddhist outfit at the time of
OL,19,FTuesday's attack, said he grabbed the
OL,20,Frider's jacket to stop him approaching
OL,21,Fbut was punched in the face before
OL,22,Fanother youth kicked him to the ground.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
